---
alwaysApply: true
---

The app API runs in the Electron **main process** (`electron/main.js` + `electron/services/api-service.js`), not a separate HTTP server. The renderer calls it via **IPC** (`desktop.request`, `orders:sync`, etc.). To pick up main-process changes, restart Electron (e.g. `pnpm electron:dev` or `pnpm electron:start`).
